#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "498672"
msgid "It's an aimless loop de loop.\nAll I ever do is say \"no.\"\nBut that's no problem."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "499012"
msgid "…#C236196003Jinako#CDEF's voice isn't directed towards us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "499076"
msgid "She mutters to herself without cease.\nNot a single whisper goes out to me or #C236196003#SVT#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "499632"
msgid "PAPA HAS DIED.\nMAMA HAS DIED.\nAnd the flags were nonexistent."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "499980"
msgid "….so.\nWhy is it that, before I knew it,\nI ended up all alone?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "500124"
msgid "Wasn't it a chore?\nWasn't it a PITA?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "500484"
msgid "I mean, I'm almost thirty. I can't go out NOW!\nGoing out now's only asking for a bad time!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "500688"
msgid "Aah――\nA lie. That was a lie!\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF lied just now!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "501040"
msgid "Everything is a lie.\nReality is a lie.\nI, too, am a lie."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "501464"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF's suffocating soliloquy comes to rest.\nHer inner voice pleads for its own destruction."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "501588"
msgid "Except, can such a plea truly be so?\nThe voice whispers that everything is a lie.\nAre these conclusions not also fabrications?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "501744"
msgid "Self-denial is human nature.\nIt's a hardship that everyone bears, not just #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

