#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "511312"
msgid "　You cannot carry any more\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr "　Você não pode carregar mais\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "511368"
msgid "You may now save your current game data\n            as #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."
msgstr "Agora você pode salvar seus dados\n         como #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "511452"
msgid "     You may use this data to carry\nover elements to the start of a new game."
msgstr "     Você pode usar esses dados para levar\nelementos ao início de um novo jogo."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "511532"
msgid "Please be careful to not overwrite\n  the data while you are saving."
msgstr "Tome cuidado para não sobrescrever\n  os dados ao salvar."

#. unk_op1653
msgctxt "511600"
msgid "Would you like to save your Clear Data?"
msgstr "Deseja salvar seus Clear Data?"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line1
msgctxt "511640"
msgid "Are you sure you wish to exit"
msgstr "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2
msgctxt "511672"
msgid "without saving the Clear Data?"
msgstr "sem salvar os Clear Data?"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "511704"
msgid "…I fall within an intense atmosphere."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "511744"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF's mind was unique.\nIt lacked the same #RUBS    charm #RUBEinfluence#REND as the others."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "511856"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF, #C236196003Rani#CDEF, and #C236196003Lip#CDEF's minds were wells of\ndissatisfaction. Dissatisfaction towards the\nworld. Towards their ideals. Towards themselves."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "512040"
msgid "But #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's mind murmurs\nsolely of \"dissatisfaction towards itself.\"\nThe mind targets only the mind for #RUBS  a Game Over#RUBEpunishment#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "512204"
msgid "My body won't move. Can't move. Doesn't want to.\nI won't do anything. Can't do anything.\nDon't want to stick my neck out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "512328"
msgid "Trying made my brain hurt, and I never wanted to\nbring anyone down. I'd land wherever I needed to\neventually, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "512448"
msgid "What else is life \"for\"?\n\"The greater good\"? \"Enrichment\"?\nThat's all PEBCAK-apologist junk."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "512544"
msgid "See, everybody dies in the end. If we're all\nheaded for the same \"Thanks for playing\" screen,\nwhy should anyone care how I played my game?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "512684"
msgid "It was painfully obvious that #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's true enemy\nwasn't #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF the invader, but Jinako herself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "512824"
msgid "A BABY #C236196003JINAKO#CDEF APPEARED!\nTHE BABY #C236196003JINAKO#CDEF DIED!\nMAMA AND PAPA WERE BETTER OFF FOR IT!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "512940"
msgid "If life is made up of two connecting dots,\nthen I say the simpler the route, the better."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "513032"
msgid "I don't need any of the ups-and-downs.\nOptional events are a waste.\nTaking shortcuts sounds fine by me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "513136"
msgid "I mean,\nno matter how happy I might actually be…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "513188"
msgid "My life was on easy mode.\nIn this game, I didn't need to score points.\nI even   made a lot   of friends."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "513296"
msgid "My online friends? Not bad party members,\nI'd say! Of course they'd never change.\nWith them, life'd be smooth sailing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "513416"
msgid "My condolences to everyone forced to play\nthis shitty game. It is I, the one and only \n#C236196003jinaKO#CDEF, who is the winner!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "513548"
msgid "Boyfriends! Careers! Achievements! Marriage!\nWhat good are they, really? Don't you realize\nhow long it takes to pull that stuff off!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "513684"
msgid "Sweating, crying, laughing!\nHow stupid!\nHow can they take that sorta #RUBS game#RUBElife#REND seriously!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "513792"
msgid "Oh yeah! Everyone is Stupid; great job, Stupids!\nSorry, but you won't catch me befriending\nStupid. Because I'm not Stupid!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "513916"
msgid "Hangin' out? Big yikes.\nFriends, hard work, victory―also yikes!\nI, uh… mentally repressed that sorta stuff."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "514028"
msgid "Why does everyone look like they're having fun!?\nWhy is everyone so bright and happy!?\n…why don't I have any fun?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "514144"
msgid "Aren't cheats the best?\nEasy mode for the win!\nSkip to the final level!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "514216"
msgid "Much fun, very joy,\njust finish me off――NO, stupid! Don't!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "514280"
msgid "That's a lie. A lie! Lie, lie, lie!\nLie, lie, lie, lie, lie, lie, lie, lie,\nLIE, LIE, LIE, LIE, LIE, LIE, LIE, LIE!!!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "514400"
msgid "I have no reality. From that moment on, I was\ngone without a trace. I'm an invisible person,\nconsuming electricity and nothing more."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "514536"
msgid "Don't waste your time on me, and while we're at\nit, don't get your hopes up that I'll ever\nchange. Please. Don't call me a \"friend.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "514672"
msgid "I'm not capable of anything.\nNever have been, never will be.\nI'm a shell of what I left behind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "514768"
msgid "Ultimately――I'm useless.\nAll I'm good for is piling up dust…\nuntil I quietly phase out of existence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "514872"
msgid "―――A journey through an infinitely hallucinating mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "514932"
msgid "After this momentary sensation, or perhaps,\nthis passing of an eternity,\nI approach the center of #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's heart――"
msgstr ""

